  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞２楼　节目走廊\n　“阿坎纳电影节”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们似乎正在争论什么……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 09}喂，埃癸斯。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 76 0B}什么事？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}刚才在迷宫里，我和真次郎的比赛，\n到底谁赢了？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 09 01 02 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D5 0C}……阿明。\n你还在计较那种事？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}比赛，顾名思义，就是有胜有负。\n正因为有输赢，人才能努力，\n不是吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}半途意识模糊是我失策，\n但究竟是谁站到了最后，\n我想弄清楚。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A6 11}切，无聊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}埃癸斯，告诉他。\n是我赢了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 09}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}你自己还不是不服输，\n真不坦率。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}所以，埃癸斯。\n到底如何？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}两位完全同时断气了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_151.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AC 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}什么？\n不，我们又没断气。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
